# w.lang.ro/shards/words-k.genres: the Romanian words for the genres of k.genres (the kind of text), their parts (the section a text has) and their rhetorical moves (what a sentence does). A letter as a genre is "scrisoare"; "literă" is only the character of the alphabet (dictionary sense letter.noun.2). Salut is the greeting of a letter; "formulă de adresare" is the formal name for it. These are general words of the genre domain, not one sentence's row (psys2 Q102).
# sources: hand-core 1 (written by a language model from psys2 questions.md Q101, Q102 and the English names of k.genres; model-made values, for a native speaker to check)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: none (hand-written)

